<title>USA: Cirrus Logic sells wireless unit.</title>
<headline>Cirrus Logic sells wireless unit.</headline>
<dateline>FREMONT, Calif. 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cirrus Logic Inc said it completed the sale of the Wireless Infrastructure Equipment group of its PCSI subsidiary, to ADC Telecommunications Inc in Minneapolis.</p>
<p>Cirrus said the sale involved &quot;a cash transaction worth approximately $23 million.&quot; The company said it will realize a net gain from the transaction in its third quarter ending December 31.</p>
</text>
